 "story": "Liverpool came from behind to beat Brentford 2-1 at the Gtech Community Stadium in the Premier League. Keane Lewis-Potter gave Brentford the lead in the 44th minute, assisted by Igor Thiago, before Víctor Muñoz equalised in the 62nd minute from a Florian Wirtz assist. Alexander Isak scored the winner in the 70th minute, set up by Bradley Barcola. The result leaves Liverpool fifth in the table with 12 points from seven games.",
